skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
component AgentRuntimeManager as Runtime
component RuntimeAgentPromptLoader as Prompt
component SkillLoader as Loader
component SkillCommandSource as Commands
component "ClawConstants.Skill\n(common module)" as Constants
component MateServiceClient as MetadataClient
component HttpMateToolClient as ToolClient
Runtime --> Loader : publish and cache reload
Prompt --> Loader : load prompt skills
Loader --> Constants : name validation, description limit, file name
Commands --> Constants : name validation, paths, command prefix
Runtime --> Constants : ID_PATTERN, file limit, paths
Prompt --> Constants : file limit, paths
MetadataClient --> Constants : ID_PATTERN
ToolClient --> Constants : ID_PATTERN
note bottom of Constants
ID: skill- followed by 32 hex characters.
Name: 1 to 64 ASCII characters.
Lowercase letters and digits.
Single hyphens separate nonempty groups.
No leading, trailing or repeated hyphens.
Description: at most 1024 characters.
File size: at most 1 MiB.
Directory and files: skills, SKILL.md, skill.json.
Command prefix: skill:
end note
note bottom of Runtime
Reject invalid publication.
Preserve the last valid directory on refresh failure.
Reject invalid cache and refetch on prepare.
end note
note bottom of Prompt
Invalid skills are omitted from the prompt.
end note
note top of Loader
Require an explicit nonempty String.
Validate with the shared strict name rule.
Match the directory name exactly.
No fallback, coercion, trim, or rename.
Single load fails; bulk scan skips invalid files.
end note
note bottom of Commands
Invalid names produce no command.
end note
@enduml
